LAMMPS (29 Oct 2020)
# Initialize simulation
units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p p
atom_style atomic

# Read the displaced structure
read_data disp-001.lammps
Reading data file ...
  triclinic box = (0.0000000 0.0000000 0.0000000) to (8.5686328 7.4206536 6.9962593) with tilt (4.2843164 4.2843164 2.4735512)
  4 by 2 by 2 MPI processor grid
  reading atoms ...
  27 atoms
  read_data CPU = 0.002 seconds

# Define interatomic potential

pair_style mlip mlip.ini
pair_coeff * *

# Apply fix to ensure static calculation
fix 1 all setforce NULL NULL NULL

# Output forces
thermo_style custom step temp pe press
dump 1 all custom 1 forces.lammpstrj id type x y z fx fy fz
run 0
